From 6f4a35b794d1f12bebb840a1499d047e89e20f8d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sternnick review <review@localhost>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 19:43:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(ui): reset the action-text cache in hideAction

The action handler compares the new text against ctrl.actionText before
calling SetText, but hideAction cleared the label without clearing that
cache. The next identical action text therefore compares equal and is
never re-painted, leaving the action line permanently blank.

Reachable today: Trial.lua:186-192 calls hideAction() whenever no health
rule matches, and Falgravn sets hideActionWhenNoRule, so the cycle is
'rule text -> blank -> same rule text' inside a single pull.

Evidence, exact line numbers and the reproduction command are in .review/code-review-2026-09-01.md (see finding F-08).
Verification: static analysis only - not run in-game.
---
 ui/Panel.lua | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/ui/Panel.lua b/ui/Panel.lua
index 20bb944..fb77dc4 100644
--- a/ui/Panel.lua
+++ b/ui/Panel.lua
@@ -215,6 +215,7 @@ Panel.alerts = {
     hideAction = function()
         if not ctrl then return end
         ctrl.action:SetText("")
+        ctrl.actionText = ""   -- keep the action= diff cache in sync
         -- leave panel visible  -  info lines may still carry timer data
     end,
 
-- 
2.54.0


From b8377b39e6a249cf2fd5cae653140e827682ffc3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sternnick review <review@localhost>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 19:43:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fix(ui): name the overlay root control Incha_Panel

ESO only exposes global controls whose names begin with the addon's own
name (ADDON_NAME comes from the folder, so "incha"/"Incha" here - see
bootstrap.lua:15-19). "InchPanel" matches neither form, so the control is
created but not registered as a global and ESO logs a warning. Renaming
costs nothing: ui/Panel.lua keeps the object in the local `ctrl`, no other
file mentions the name, and nothing reads it back.

UNVERIFIED assumption: that ESO rejects or warns on a non-conforming name.
Worth one /reloadui + /eventtrace check before merging.
---
 ui/Panel.lua | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/ui/Panel.lua b/ui/Panel.lua
index fb77dc4..8aab1a8 100644
--- a/ui/Panel.lua
+++ b/ui/Panel.lua
@@ -77,7 +77,7 @@ local function build()
     local sv = Settings.get().overlay
 
     -- Outer container  -  the draggable root.
-    local panel = WINDOW_MANAGER:CreateControl("InchPanel", GuiRoot, CT_CONTROL)
+    local panel = WINDOW_MANAGER:CreateControl("Incha_Panel", GuiRoot, CT_CONTROL)
     panel:SetDimensions(W, H)
     panel:SetClampedToScreen(true)
     panel:SetMouseEnabled(not sv.locked)
-- 
2.54.0

